cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:1377:(declare pattern-of)\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:1683:  \"Warn when `lc` names a catalogue function that neither the unit declares\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:1688:             (not (contains? (:declared ctx) lc)))\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:1822:        user-lc (first (filter #(contains? (:declared ctx) %) [primary-lc fallback-lc]))\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:1844:        ;; are language constructs and cannot be user-declared.\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:1876:                      (let [call (call-node ctx (u/v f) arguments (get (:declared ctx) user-lc))]\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:2144:   `__FILE__`/`__DIR__` the unit's declared path and directory (C37),\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:2811:   declared type value, `:promote` `{:vis :readonly?}` for a promoted\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:2868:  \"`const X = e, Y = f;` at unit or namespace level: each name is declared\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:2875:                    (app* 'php/const-declare!\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:2922:  \"A returned value held to the declared type `rtype`; `static` resolves to the\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3242:    (app* 'php/declare-function!\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3356:  \"The property entries a constructor's promoted parameters declare.\"\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3406:  \"The method declared by `st` (a `classStatement` or a `functionDeclaration`);\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3554:(defn- lower-declare\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3555:  \"`declare(strict_types=1)` switches the unit to strict scalar typing; `ticks`\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3558:  (let [ds (mapcat #(core/rules ctx % \"directive\") (core/rules ctx n \"declareList\"))\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3569:  \"A class declared in place (nested or conditional): declared when reached.\"\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3572:    (u/then (app* 'php/dec