oncat \"Access to undeclared static property \"\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:3769:                              \" and must therefore be declared abstract or implement the remaining methods (\"\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:3827:    [php/declare-class!\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:3854:                            (data/str-concat \"Cannot declare \" (php/kind-word kind) \" \" name\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:3882:     ;; a declared default is held to the type like a property default: exact,\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:3957:     ;; declared before the unit runs when everything it needs already exists\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:3961:           (if (nil? (php/class-lookup (get spec :name))) (php/declare-class! spec) :php/null)\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:3963:    [php/declare-late!\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:3967:         (if (nil? (php/class-lookup (get spec :name))) (php/declare-class! spec) :php/null)))]\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:4336:                            (data/str-concat \"Access to undeclared static property \" (get c :name) \"::$\" name))\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:5977:  \"The properties and native methods Exception and Error declare, which every\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:6279:                     :message \"the php module reads an undeclared name\",\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
