 path)))\n                (u/lit {})\n                (sort paths))))\n\n\n(defn lower-program\n  \"`{:ast a :warnings [d ...]}` for one ok packet: the unit body run by\n   `php/run-main` after the prelude, tail calls marked. Its value is\n   `{:php/out s :php/diag [...] :php/uncaught nil-or-{:class :message}}`.\n   `:warnings` are the lowering's warning-severity diagnostics\n   (`:yang.php/unknown-builtin`, `:yang.php/compile-warning`,\n   `:yang.php/computed-include-path`).\n\n   Options: `:prelude` is `:bundled` (default; the prelude tree ahead of the\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:1:(ns yang.php.antlr.safepoint\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:2:  \"The PHP `:loop` and `:call` hooks. A bounded run charges one safepoint to\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:10:  {:loop 'php.sp/loop, :call {:hook 'php.sp/call, :sequence true}})\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:16:  {:line {:hook 'php.sp/line, :operands true, :after true}})\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:24:  '[[php.sp/exhaust!\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:29:    [php.sp/tick\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:31:       (let [n (cell/get php.sp/remaining)]\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:33:           (php.sp/exhaust!)\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:34:           (do (cell/set! php.sp/remaining (- n 1)) :php/null))))]\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:35:    [php.sp/loop (fn [] (php.sp/tick))]\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:36:    [php.sp/call (fn [] (php.sp/tick))]])\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:46:   safepoint-derived program `ast`. `budget` must be a non-negative integer;\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:50:    (throw (ex-info \"php.sp/remaining budget must be a non-negative integer\"\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:51:                    {:yang.php.antlr.safepoint/error :invalid-budget\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc:55:            (u/then (u/def! 'php.sp/remaining (u/sexp->uast (list 'cell/new